# The walk dm/verify/motion_gate.py measures: back and forth along the same lines on the open ground of the Far Oasis, so that the hero really moves through the place, the camera follows her and the
# ground slides behind her the whole time. A wall would stop the camera, and with it most of what goes wrong: thin things lost against moving scenery only show when she keeps going. It needs
# DM_MV_TRACE (the gate sets it) for the limbs.
name motion_walk
requires cli
save warlock
env DM_GAME_SEED=305419896
env DM_TEST_GOTO_LEVEL=150:42
timeout 100

enter_game
sleep 7
mark go
stick 0.7 0.0 60
stick -0.7 0.0 60
stick 0.0 0.7 60
stick 0.0 -0.7 60
stick 0.7 0.0 60
stick -0.7 0.0 60
stick 0.0 0.7 60
stick 0.0 -0.7 60
sleep 1
quit
check no_red
